    <description>Warmup: 5min from 45% to 80% FTP | Steady: 40s @ 80% FTP | Steady: 20s @ 55% FTP | Steady: 40s @ 80% FTP | Steady: 1min 20s @ 55% FTP | Steady: 4min @ 83% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 4min @ 83% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 4min @ 83% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 4min @ 83% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 4min @ 83% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 4min @ 83% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 4min @ 83% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 4min @ 83% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 4min @ 83% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 55% FTP | Cooldown: 3min from 75% to 55% FTP</description>
